    seed_jit_erased_float_arg_heap_box_per_call_never_released_2026-11-27, P2, open, "Seed JIT: every f64 passed to an untyped parameter heap-boxes a float that is never released in the loop (30s, 1.3 GB per 4e7 calls)", src/compiler_rust/compiler/src/mir/lower/lowering_expr_call.rs, 0, NONE, 2026-11-27, 2026-11-27, true
